WEBVTT

00:03:29.723 --> 00:03:32.643
(Applause)

00:03:34.977 --> 00:03:37.647
And then the son, Kim Jong-un,

00:03:37.671 --> 00:03:40.352
proved himself a worthy
successor to the throne.

00:03:40.376 --> 00:03:42.926
He's now friends with the US president.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:47.503
They meet each other all the time,
and they talk like friends.

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.065
[What kind of hair gel?]

00:03:49.089 --> 00:03:52.489
(Laughter)

00:03:54.138 --> 00:03:56.378
Should we be surprised

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.185
to be living in a world

00:03:58.209 --> 00:04:00.254
ruled by egomaniacs?